          <change when="2013-01-25T11:32:49.971-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/james.cowey">Vote - AcceptText - This looks good. There is not much left to see of the epsilon of τέλ(ει). The first stroke of the lambda is rather vertical in appearance, but as there is damage here and a break in the papyrus perhaps to be realigned. The second stroke of the lambda with its curl at the bottom is comparable to the lambda in Φλ(αουίου) in line 2 and Αὐρηλίῳ in line 6.</change>
